### Alfa aprova (parcela R$ 312,24 cabe em 30% de R$ 3.000)
POST http://localhost:4000/banco-alfa/propostas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salario": 3000, "valor": 10000, "prazoMeses": 48 }

### Alfa nega (parcela passa de 30%)
POST http://localhost:4000/banco-alfa/propostas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salario": 3000, "valor": 30000, "prazoMeses": 48 }

### Beta aprova o MESMO caso que o Alfa negou (margem de 35%)
POST http://localhost:4000/banco-beta/v1/credit-analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthly_income": 3000, "amount": 30000, "installments": 48, "birth_date": "1990-05-10", "employer_document": "11222333000181" }

### Beta R01 (idade no fim do contrato acima de 75)
POST http://localhost:4000/banco-beta/v1/credit-analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthly_income": 3000, "amount": 10000, "installments": 96, "birth_date": "1955-01-01", "employer_document": "11222333000181" }

